WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,080
Continue to the next one. Next time, don’t be like this.

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,800
I really don’t have much syrup.

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:08,560
That guy was chased

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:13,280
Quick, quick, keep cracking me

5
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,520
You are the Holy Body of the Horse that was born to break the secret.

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:16,720
Why can't I do it?

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:20,760
Maybe God is blessing me, senior, come on

8
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,560
You two brats, hurry up!

9
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,880
I'm being chased around

10
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,680
You two are still here playing the piano and talking about love

11
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,880
I don't believe it anymore

12
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:28,960
Let me be the last one

13
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:40,150
Stay away quickly, I don’t know now

14
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:41,470
What will happen to the stone pillars?
